  "description": "Drop-in libwkhtmltox.dylib for macOS Apple Silicon (arm64) that makes DinkToPdf work\n      natively on M1/M2/M3/M4 Macs without running an x86 container.\n\n      Reimplements the wkhtmltopdf C API using WKWebView (Safari's engine) and\n      CGPDFContext/NSPrintOperation — the helper binary is embedded inside the dylib,\n      so only one file is shipped.\n\n      Install this package alongside DinkToPdf and the native library is automatically\n      placed in runtimes/osx-arm64/native/ at build time.",
  "id": "DinkToPdf.MacArmFix",
